  "details": "As a 2D artist, it would be very helpful to have official templates for various banners' sizes, aspect ratios, etc.\n\nThis not only applies to groups, but also to avatar thumbnails, world thumbnails and loading screen pictures, etc.\n\nAnd restrict changing those templates too much from there on: I have had to redo my group's banner because there was a silent change that lowered the center point of the banner's appearance on player's nameplates, it is better now, but try to communicate those changes.\n\nAn example of some good templates are Steam's UI templates here:\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/groups/steamworks/announcements/detail/1597002662762032240",
